        "label": "Apply accepted file suggestions",
        "job": "Apply the title and folder suggestions this person accepted as one tidy-up: record each title and move each file into its folder by name",
        "description": "Every accepted suggestion (or those of ids) is checked again first: a file renamed, moved or replaced since, what is known about it changed since, or a name already taken refuses that one (state stale, with why). The rest are applied together as one tidy-up that can be undone; the files' bytes are never touched. Returns tidy_up, applied, refused ({ id, name, reason }) and said.",
        "input_schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "ids": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        },
